rtising platforms through its own and various third party websites, mobile and over-the-top applications, digital media solutions to media publishers and advertisers, and a consumer product reviews platform. In addition, it owns NewsNation, a national cable news network; and WGN-AM, a Chicago radio station, as well as owns and operates digital multicast networks. Further, its digital assets include 125 local websites, 229 mobile applications, 110 connected television applications, television channels from The CW and The Hill, BestReviews, and advertising solutions. Additionally, the company engages in the digital business. Its stations are affiliates of ABC, NBC, FOX, CBS, The CW, MyNetworkTV, and other broadcast television networks. Nexstar Media Group, Inc. was formerly known as Nexstar Broadcasting Group, Inc. and changed its name to Nexstar Media Group, Inc. in January 2017. The company was founded in 1996 and is headquartered in Irving, Texas.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Perry A. Sook | Founder, Chairman & CEO | Age 67 | Compensation: $9.9M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Governance score flags low compensation governance risk (2/10).","financial_summary":["Nexstar Media Group, Inc. is a mid-cap communication services business with a $6.4B market cap on $4.9B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at -2% over the past three years and +19% annually across the full decade \u2014 essentially flat, and a business treading water is rarely a path to compounding.","Returns on capital run at 9% against a 7% cost of capital, which means the business barely earns its keep economically.","The business throws off $743M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 15 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 8.17\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, debt is heavy at 4.6\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and leverage like that is what turns a bad year into a permanent loss, and thin 2.3\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Management returns a meaningful 5.5% of market cap to owners through dividends and buybacks, a strong signal of disciplined capital allocation, and insiders hold 6.7% of the shares."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (1.7) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"News sentiment sharply negative (-0.38) across 12 recent articles \u2014 the narrative has turned","sev":"red","cat":"news"},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Elevated short interest (12.9% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting the other way","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Insiders are overwhelmingly selling (92% sell ratio) \u2014 the people who know the business want less of it","sev":"amber","cat":"insider","ratio":0.077},{"text":"Advertising-cycle exposure and content/regulatory risk \u2014 a single platform policy shift or ad-spend contraction cascades through the P&L quickly.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Cord-cutting acceleration and audience fragmentation \u2014 legacy distribution bundles unravel faster than subscription revenue can replace them.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"AI-generated content commoditisation \u2014 as creation costs collapse toward zero, content libraries lose pricing power and differentiation narrows.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Operating margins 9% above sector median \u2014 the quantitative trace of pricing power","Trading at a 68% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","13 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Tucker County community in shock after learning DC shooting suspect was a local","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/tucker-county-community-shock-learning-234503000.html","date":"2026-11-14","timestamp":1794616581.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.896,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Travelers stuck in Lansing amid nationwide flight grounding","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/travelers-stuck-lansing-amid-nationwide-231040000.html","date":"2026-11-14","timestamp":1794614782.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.25,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"FAA ground stop affects flights at Jackson airport","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/faa-ground-stop-affects-flights-225848000.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794613126.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.649,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Wisconsin airports react to the FAA grounding all flights","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/wisconsin-airports-react-faa-grounding-222134000.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794610639.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.153,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Austin-Bergstrom International Airport affected by nationwide ground stop","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/austin-bergstrom-international-airport-affected-222402000.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794610516.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.681,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Tri-Cities Airport issues statement after flights halted across country","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/tri-cities-airport-issues-statement-220647000.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794610368.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.153,"tier":2,"scope":"co